{"4673230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Breeze Of Adventure", "steam_appid": 4673230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4673230/extras/9fda2aaad7e09388617e9267744d1b55.avif?t=1783249947\" width=1080 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an adventurer in a vast, richly detailed world.<br>Travel across islands, discover powerful weapons, collect armor, complete quests for the Dawn Guild — or forge your own path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the 7 powerful Overseer Gods to regain your lost memory and find your way back to the surface in this anime-inspired adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is filled with adventurers like you, whom you will encounter along your journey. Explore mysterious locations and uncover hidden treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master 4 weapon types:<br>swords, hammers (or clubs), war scythes, and dual blades.<br>A wide variety of armor is available, and some weapons feature unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also discover God Soul Fragments and magical runes that grant supernatural powers — ancient remnants of your ancestors, each holding only a fraction of their true strength.<br><br>There are 4 unique types of weapons in the game - Battle Scythe, Hammer, Long Sword, and Daggers. Each of them uses a unique combo of attacks, as well as a powerful attack, and some rare weapons have their own special attack with magic.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4673230/extras/3f881388845df465fec94311fdd866bc.poster.avif?t=1783249947\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4673230/extras/3f881388845df465fec94311fdd866bc.webm?t=1783249947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4673230/extras/3f881388845df465fec94311fdd866bc.mp4?t=1783249947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Also in the combat system, magical shards of the power of the gods, or runes, play an important role. With their help, you can use unique magical techniques.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4673230/extras/b6c78c2a1fa3d5d0837c9bdf6de2b7dd.poster.avif?t=1783249947\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4673230/extras/b6c78c2a1fa3d5d0837c9bdf6de2b7dd.webm?t=1783249947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4673230/extras/b6c78c2a1fa3d5d0837c9bdf6de2b7dd.mp4?t=1783249947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>NOTICE:</strong> The current Steam Next Fest Demo is available in <strong>English only</strong>. Full localization into Spanish, Chinese, Japanese, and other major languages is actively planned for the final release! Add the game to your Wishlist to stay updated!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4673230/extras/9fda2aaad7e09388617e9267744d1b55.avif?t=1783249947\" width=1080 height=500 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4673230/extras/9fda2aaad7e09388617e9267744d1b55.avif?t=1783249947\" width=1080 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an adventurer in a vast, richly detailed world.<br>Travel across islands, discover powerful weapons, collect armor, complete quests for the Dawn Guild — or forge your own path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the 7 powerful Overseer Gods to regain your lost memory and find your way back to the surface in this anime-inspired adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is filled with adventurers like you, whom you will encounter along your journey. Explore mysterious locations and uncover hidden treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master 4 weapon types:<br>swords, hammers (or clubs), war scythes, and dual blades.<br>A wide variety of armor is available, and some weapons feature unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also discover God Soul Fragments and magical runes that grant supernatural powers — ancient remnants of your ancestors, each holding only a fraction of their true strength.<br><br>There are 4 unique types of weapons in the game - Battle Scythe, Hammer, Long Sword, and Daggers. Each of them uses a unique combo of attacks, as well as a powerful attack, and some rare weapons have their own special attack with magic.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4673230/extras/3f881388845df465fec94311fdd866bc.poster.avif?t=1783249947\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4673230/extras/3f881388845df465fec94311fdd866bc.webm?t=1783249947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4673230/extras/3f881388845df465fec94311fdd866bc.mp4?t=1783249947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Also in the combat system, magical shards of the power of the gods, or runes, play an important role. With their help, you can use unique magical techniques.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st